{"completed": true, "response": "他还说不清自己到底在怕什么，就先顺着这份喜欢，和那个人慢慢相处。两个人以后会怎样，可以以后再想；眼下，他只是喜欢对方，想和对方亲近。这样想着，他慢慢觉得，自己可以安心地靠近那个人了。\n\n他很喜欢这种感觉。心里有些温柔，他想给那个人就给出去；至于对方有没有收到、心里怎么想，他先让事情顺其自然。那个人对他很重要，他还是能自在地做自己的事。有时他甚至觉得，自己比之前更自在了。原来喜欢一个人，心里也可以很安心；他能认真地在乎对方，自己也照样轻松自在。\n\n这份快乐确实让他心里踏实了许多。他渐渐敢顺着自己的喜欢走，甚至有点满意自己能这样温和地对待那个人。要是两个人能一直这样自然而然地亲近下去，平常相处轻轻松松，心里少些猜测和计较，那该多好。他当时觉得，这样就够了。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4e21ec47-1ee2-430e-9145-920658d45824", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002123077892Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.687, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:22:10.773458+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5756776295e47b2f8b513beb0fb2e0efb4b719d87bf9ff08d71cf17358533713", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_